<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="h">Corinthiame Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Corinthiame Dage raukegai laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Corinthiame Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Cor.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Corinthiame dage raukegai laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Corinthiame kenabe aide laisiu keraibe raukedi cai peting kiekemak ge cai AD 55-56 dau rau kegai nzwa. Corinthiame keraibe ga kebam pangkepop nah makenaangdung de cude Corinth ngqwa ga bamreu. Paul pekatei de Corinth ga mbeuh kelwamie lubui, dede püt zette di kedanemene ngqwa ga midung ge nli raudi nah Paul au Tinggwang ne langkegaibe melie di.</para>
  <para style="ip">Macedonia ga cailigwang kelucai, Titus ne samliakeyi Corinthiame ngqwa ga minadung penui kenaangdung nah kemaudung cilwe nli dineu bam kedi ha peda teugwang beuge, Paul pesui yilu. Cipau tingdau Paul pe laisiu kenabe aide Corinthiame dage raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiu kerai lambie Corinthiame ndaa teimau kedi nah cu au Tinggwang lungningbe nzwa lunghdi kera teibam kedi ha siu luge daikenzwa gede pe suiyi nah nggaibi kecu ranggai. Laisiu kekam lebie mina pecu ngkau kelame nah pe ha kesang kemak rang kelame dade, Paul pekatei pecu regum kecu sam ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Samkeraibe (1:1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang gwabe Paul (1:12-7:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbang eh makekai (8:1-9:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Langkegaibe Paul (10:1-13:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (13:11-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Paul, Tinggwang lungning gade Khrista Jisu ne langkegaibe, nah Timothy anui sinabe, Corinth namdi ga kebam Tinggwang ngqwa, nah kemcime pelane Achaia cuikui leune ga kebamme dage kekai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paul ne laisiu aide raugai, Timothy au kelumkegai sam rünne ga si.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Anui Pei Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade kegwang lungciep nah ngaugia de peu nnuida bam lulo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang pelane de kerelui peula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista Peibe, ngaugia Peibe nah maleune gade helungtaumla beu kelabe Tinggwang de peu hetwa pungkelube tei lulo, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />pa ne anui rei pelane gade anuide tei relui beula, iciu eh anui kehei leu ga rei kelame de Tinggwang ne anuide tei relui kebeu de teu kerelui peulu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kedanemene Khrista reidung ga anui ngngwa reikelu nzwa, cinzwa eh anuide Khrista gade kerelui ngau lula. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Dede anuide keherei lalie cai, cide au nnui relui nah kelilu kera ziemne da; anui reluilu cai, cide au nnuide tei reluilu kerane, iciu eh anui keherei kegai de nzwa nnui rei kecu dau helungtie eh lialu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Nah anui keregui nnui da kebam de au ntip bam, nnui keherei kecu ga ngngwa reibeu kelame kecu ci eh, iciu delwe kerelui ga liede. <verse eid="2CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Kedanemene anui peu nnuide cimene laneu ma, sinamedung, Asia deuceu gade anui keherei kecu ha de. Anuide tei keherei sütdi eh anui liagai kelak reige rei eh anui ringlu kera de cetlu tadi. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Kesang, anuide teitset dilo eh sam kaikebeu bam dida, iciulu eh anuikatei anuide nlumdi melu kerane, dede Tinggwang ketsaime de kwakcuh kelube de nlumlu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ketsai kengngi cikenzwa gade pa anuide kelibeu, nah Tinggwang anuide keli beuzie. Anui pe dage anui keregui kai dida, nah pa anui mapie jüja la luzie, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />nnui anui mding tei eh ngngwa kekie ketei ga ncütkelu gade. Iciude mina kekiee ge kekie gade anuide ngha kebeune mina kekiee ge anui ding tei eh pecu ketwa peu luzie.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul pe tariem teilei kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Kedanemene anui hegie kela au aide da: anui lungcet zierang de, cide kideu ga anui teilung nah bam keraide nnuide ngngwa riangkeu kecu ga anui mci nah Tinggwang masang gage lunggai lu kecu deda, cide pumteih maci gade ma, dede Tinggwang ngaugia gade. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Kedanemene anui nnui dage ma kedage de raugai ma, dede nnui pei nah cilu kebuibe rünne. Nah nnui cicangsiak luzie ha Ih regui bam, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />nnui ma kesa ci kelu nzwa, iciu eh Rampaube Jisu cailikegwang tingba benai anui ziemne nnui hegie luzie, anuide nnui ziemne hegielu kera nzwa.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Nah aide ci mci eh Ih nnui da gwang railu kera riemlu, iciu eh nnuide peu samlam reude samlam ngaulu kerane, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ih Macedonia deuceu ga kemie dau nnuide kah gwang redau nah Macedonia gade kegwang dau nnui da gwang peu nnuide acu langpwa Judea deuceu gage tetkaidi kerane. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Cine Ih ainzwa tei kera riem kecu dau, Ih lunghau dini? Mede Ih riem kelude mina mariem gade ni, iciu eh, Ih “Yeo, yeo” nah “Ma, ma” de piage gage rang ni? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Dede Tinggwang au samsang kela nzwa, nnui dage anui sam au, “Yeo” nah “Ma,” de kecube ma. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Kedanemene Tinggwang Nabe, Jisu Khrista, anui—Ih nah Silvanus nah Timothy nnui kakga ge pe ha rang kelabe de, “Yeo” nah “Ma” de kecube melie, dede pe au “Yeo” de muila. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kedanemene Tinggwang sampet pelane pe dade au “Yeo” delu. Cine Tinggwang kendu ziemne anui pe zi teu “Amen” de rangla. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Cu Tinggwang ne anuide Khrista gade nnuide ngngwa ket ketei kebeube da, nah pa ne anuide keniaklu da, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />pa anuide giak kegaibe de da, nah pa pe sam teicang beu zielie Kemci Rabe anui nlung gage kaibeu da.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Cu Ih Tinggwang de a teilung zierang lie qu gaila—Ih Corinth namdi gade gwangdai kemak au nnuide mbai beu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Aide au nnui kenlum nreu anui di bam de kecune ma, dede, anui au nnui suiyi ziemne nnuide ngngwa heta tei kelame, kedanemene nnui kenlum ga sap ntip kebamne.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Kedanemene Ih nnui da suisiet teu eh gwang dai kelak cetlu. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Kedanemene Ih nnui suisiet teidi liecai, Ih ne tei rejam kegaibe ne meliecai, caune a suiyi teibeu lulai? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Nah Ih aide nzwa pedwa raugai da, iciu eh Ih kegwang dau, a suiyi tei kerame ne a dage suisiet teigaidi melu kerane. Ih a suiyi kela ga nnuide nnui suiyi kera nnui pelane da a kenlum bam. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage keherei cangsiak nah lungrei gade nah a miakdui lwasüt eh raugai, nnui suisiet tei kerane ma, dede Ih nnui pelane de daikenzwa gede hungbi kecu peu nnuide cilu kerane.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemaube maugi kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Dede magade mige mi kedage suisiet tei cai, pa cide a dage rünne suisiet teigai ma, dede kiege gade au nnui pelane dage teigai da.(Aide Ih kerang au pe dade a zai siasütdi neu kemakne.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:12">Gal. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Hemaabe be aipau de dage saja peu kegai swa simede yida, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />cine, nnui pecu pemau gibeu nah pelung tei nciep beulu kerabe. Iciu meliecai, cikenzwame lungrei kekiee le kepui teidi zielu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Eph. 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Cine Ih nnuide pecu nnui keku kesangde mtei dwa gade keulia lulo kecung gaila. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ih aipau kie de ziemne de laisiu raugai da, iciu eh nnui makeheibe gade samzai tei mi mebi kecu Ih nnuide cilu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Cu nnui keheibe de kehei leune mau gibeu cai, Ih de gibeu zie, kedanemene kesang Ih mimau gi kebeu de (Ih mimau kehei leune gibeu liecai), Ih nnui ziemne Khrista dwa gade gibeu dida, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />iciu eh peu Satan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Satan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 16:23</char></note> de anui reu ngkieng pwadi melu kerane. Kedanemene anui pe ciemdung cikemakbe melu.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu kehecibe gwaketeime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Cu Ih Troas namdi ga gwang keludau, Rampaube gade acu Khrista samliakeyi de pau kera ziemne lampui ge ngkeibeu. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ih a lung keherei sütdi, kedanemene Ih a sinabe Titus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Titus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Titus au, Timothy nzwa, Paul zangme ge nah ngngwa heta teikelame ge.</char></note> de cikade ngaulu kemakne. Cine Ih penuide gidi eh Macedonia ga miedi.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Dede Tinggwang, Khrista gade anuide ngkieng kelu gage saulia mui kelabe de twa, nah heni leune ga pe maci ha kehengui de peu anui dade cila dida. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kedanemene anui au Tinggwang da Khrista gu marim kehengui geda, kelikelumedung nah kapdi kerame kakga, <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />kesang, kapdi kerame ziemne au ketsai riem ge, dede ringlu kerame ziemne au marim kehengui kering ge. Cau ne aidungde teilu bui no? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Anui au gielu kerane mikedame nzwa Tinggwang sam zwatyei ma, iciu meliene Tinggwang anuide lang kegai nzwa, lungsang tei eh Khrista gade anui Tinggwang dwa marangla.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Anuikatei anuide twa dai zeu dereu ni? Anui mi kedame nzwa, nnui dage, mede nnui dade zierangketei laisiudung teu maisia ni? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Nnui au anui gu laisiu da, mina pelane ci nah peilu kera anui nlung gage rau teula, <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />nnui au anui kusüt kecu Khrista dade laisiu gelie kecu lia kegai ge, cide keraudui le rauma, dede ringkela Tinggwang Rabe le raulu, tangtsukwakdung gage ma, dede mina nlung gage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Tet. 24:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer. 31:33</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:19-20">Eze. 11:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Nah anui Khrista gade Tinggwang da anui kenlum cikenzwa bam. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Anui anuikatei teilubui eh ma keheibe de anui dade gwanglie kecube ma. Meliene, anui teilu kebuibe au Tinggwang dade gwangla, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />pa ne anuide peu samkakkelu kehecibe gwa teilukebui tei beula, cide hezai raukelube gade ma dede Rabe gade. Kedanemene hezai raukelube au ketsai teugwang beula, dede Kemci Rabe kering peula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Tet. 24:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:31">Jer. 31:31</ref>;<ref loc="JER 32:40">32:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu kehecibe kendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ketsai teu gwang kela hezai, tangtsu gage rau kelu laisiu kaudung de, baaha gwang eh Israelme Moses zu kebaa de gahdi zeu liede pie gailak dicai, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Kemci Rabe ta au kendu kieeki zie meni? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Cine kemmau bata de ndu liecai, kesamsang zierang ta de daikenzwa gede kieeki zieno! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Kesang, aipau ria gade au nu piage ndusüt gwang kecude pe kendu gah dida, kedanemene pe kendu mtingki kecude ziemne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29-30">Tet. 34:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Kedanemene kaknage bamlu kela de kendu bam liecai, bammui kela de au kendu daikenzwa gede kieeki zieno.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Anui keregui cikenzwa ge kebamne, anui au kuusüt eh bata teila, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Moses pezu hepai le kezuidi kedibe nzwa ma, iciu eh Israelme gahdi kezeu kebaa de penli kecang pie melu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Tet. 34:33</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 34:35">35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Dede Israleme kecetdung au takdi. Kedanemene henai kecangde, samkakkelu kehegwa de kepeidau, cipau zu kehezuipai dene penui peusui haapwa bamdi eh penui kesangbe cilu meda. Nah kehezuipai cide au Khrista de kenlum rünne gade lwak lubui. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Dede henai kecangde, Moses zai kepei dau, kehezuipai de penui nlung ga haapwa bamla. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Dede mige Rampaube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rampaube </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rampaube Tinggwang</char></note> da nreugwang keludau, kehezuipai de lwak mpet dila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Tet. 34:34</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 25:7">Isa. 25:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Rampaube au Rabe, nah Rampaube Rabe kebam ga, suirang bam lula. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Cu anui pelane, mizu kezuidi mene, Rampaube kebaa kendu de ngau bam dida, nah anuide teintsam pwa pe rehi kebaa kendu diki kecu gage kai luda; kedanemene aide, Rampaube, pa au Rabe dade gwanglu.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Lidei bung ga mabam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Tinggwang ngaugia gade zierang ta aide anui ngau kelu nzwa, anui lung ceudi lama. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Ciciu meliene, kebai pwa kebam hengam dungde anui gi dida, mide kecwa ga tetla meda mede Tinggwang sam kemak de rang meda, dede kesangbe teu teilia eh, Tinggwang dwagade anui mina leune lungning kemzuibe tei lala. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Dede anui samliakeyi paukelade de kebaidi liecai, cide au kapdi keramedung dade kebai dida, <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Kideube rabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kideube rabe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan</char></note> penui, nlumkemakme peusuidung teimang dida, iciu eh penuide peu Khrista,Tinggwang rehibe kendu samliakeyi kebaa de peu ngau melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Kedanemene anuikatei anui zierang tei ma, dede Khrista Jisu au Rampaube lie eh nah anui au Jisu ziemne nnui kilamedung lie zierang teila. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Kedanemene, “Kemui gade kebaa baapet dizie,” de eh kerang de au Tinggwang, pa anui nlung ga baa kebambe, Tinggwang kendu kebaa maci de Jisu Khrista zu gade anuide peu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Dede anui mahei aide tangdei lidung ga bam, iciu eh kengkieng kedi de anui da bam ma dede Tinggwang da bamlie kecu keulia lu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Anui kehei leuga keherei bam dida, dede pungpai gailak dima. Anui sui mang dida dede suihak gah dima. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Anuide teikeherei süt dede püt dima. Anuide teingkau mie dede teimsia dima. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Anui pum gage Jisu tsit de anui pungla muila, ciciu eh Jisu teilung de anui pumdung gade keulialu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Kedanemene anui ring kebamme Jisu ziemne ketsai kengngi ga la muila, iciu eh Jisu teilung de anui ketsai pumteih gade keulialu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Cine ketsai au anui da bata teibam, dede kering nnuida bata teibam. <verse eid="2CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Dede cide raupwa kela nzwa rabe gade anui kenlum au nsam ciau: “Ih nlumlu; cine Ih rangla.” Anui de nlum; cine anui de rangla,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Lei. 116:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Jisu de kwakcuh kelube anuide de Jisu de ngngwa kwakcuh luzie nah anuide nnuide ngngwa pedwa gwang zielie kecu ci eh. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Kedanemene aidung pelane nnui ziemne da, ciciu eh ngaugia mina da gwang reureulu eh Tinggwang kendu ketwa de peu kieesi lu kerane.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Cine anui lung siadi lama. Meliene, anui pumteih siala liede, anui rabe de tingba ramsang ne teiheci beula. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kedanemene anui ting kaknage keherei kegai gade mdet canggai kelak kelungta kendu mdet anuide pwapeu bamlu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Anui ngau kelabedung de pie bam ma, dede ngau kemakbedung de. Kedanemene ngau kelabedung au tingkak nage ziemne, dede ngau kemakbedung au kelungta ziemne.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Tinggim ga anui ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kedanemene anui lunghkebam kideu ga paiki de ngkap dicai, anui Tinggwang dade lunghlu kera kige kebam cibam, mina bale tei kemak tinggim ga kelungta kebam kige.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:11">Heb. 9:11</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 4:19">Job 4:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Kedanemene aipau paiki gade anui mrabam, tinggim gade kegwang anui kide gumlu kera regui eh, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />kedanemene anui cide teubahlu liecai, anui au ki kegahme ge nzwata dizie. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Anui aipau paiki ga kebam dau, anui keherei eh mra bamla, kedanemene anui kideube pumbe pütdi neu kecune ma, dede tinggim paini teu bahlu keneune, iciu eh ringkebam dene ketsaide ngamlu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Cu ma aide ziemne anuide mtei pwa kelabe de au Tinggwang, pe samdung teicang beu zielie anuide Rabe kai kebeube. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ciziemne anui kekuu bam muila, anui pumteihbe ki ga kebamtane anui Rampaube dade mdei kela cibam liede, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />kedanemene anui kengau gade mene kenlum gade tetla. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />cu anui au kuubam, nah pumteihbe gade tetdi delwe Rampaube de ngngwa kilung ga bam neu dida. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Cine anui kilung ga bam liede mede tetdi de, pe suiyibe teila kera anui lungning da. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kedanemene anui pelane de Khrista tutiak bam dwaga gwang zie, iciu eh hang gege kecu pumteihbe gade tei kedidung, keyi nah kesia de pa tei kedi rehi gade ngau luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:8">Eph. 6:8</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat. 16:27</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 12:14">Kel. 12:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngngwayidaikelu ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ciziemne, Rampaube mie kehing pekie ci eh anui mide kecung lala. Dede Tinggwang ne anuide ci cangsiak bam, nah nnuide nnui lung gade anuide cibam kera Ih regui bam. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Anuikatei anui zierang nnui dage teidai ma, dede anui pelane nding gade nnuide peu hegielu kera zuiyi keyi pwapeu bam, iciu eh peu nnuide helungbe ziemne mene hegwazube ziemne hegie kelame de sam keli beulu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Kedanemene anui miedi liecai, cide au Tinggwang ziemne; anui mcing bamcai, cide au nnui ziemne. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Kedanemene Khrista keku ne anuide kezeu lala, aide nlumlu eh: Khrista pelane ziemne tsaigai beu; ciziemne pelane de teilung kehegwade gade tsai dida. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Nah pa pelane ziemne tsaibeu, ciu eh ring kebamme penuikatei penui ziemne ring bam si kelakne, dede penui ziemne tsai gai nah kwakcuh kelube ziemne. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ciziemne, anui cu gade mige dede pumteih ria gade cetla meda. Anui pumteih ria gade Khrista de cetla liede, cu au anui pecu cikenzwa gage cet sila meda. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ciziemne, keheibe de Khrista ga ladi cai, pa au mina keheci ge dida. Kehegwabe tetdi da. Ainie, kehecibe gwang bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:18">Isa. 43:18</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 43:19">19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Nah ma aidungde pelane Tinggwang, Khrista gade anuide peu pecu ngngwa kezuyi dai kelube dade gwang. Nah pa ngngwa keyi ta keteide anuide peu da. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Cide au, Khrista gade Tinggwang kideube de peu pecu ngngwa kezuyi dailu, penui mau pei penuide mmau mene, nah anuide ngngwa keyi ketei samde nlumbeu.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ciziemne, anui au Khrista sam teu kerangme dida, Tinggwang anui dade pe sam rangla. Khrista keleu tei anui nnui dade kie gaila: “Tinggwang de ngngwa kezuyi dailu lo!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:10">Eph. 6:10</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kemau cikemakbe de, anui ziemne Tinggwang pecu kemaube tei dida, iciu eh pecu ngngwa anuide Tinggwang masang de ga silu kerane.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Tinggwang de ngngwa heta keteime kecu nzwa, Tinggwang ngaugia de luu pwa kemta teidi helo nnui dage anui kiela. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Kedanemene pa rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Luulu kebui ting ga Ih nnui kwa kingneilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">nah kelikelu tingba benai Ih nnuide ngha beu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa. 49:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ainie, cu luulu kebui tingda. Ainie, cu kelikelu tingba da.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul kehereikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Anui mige dwa gage kekaam kenam ge de kaima, ciu eh anui heta tei kebamde kemta liedi melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Iciu meliene, anui Tinggwang kilame lie kecu maleune gade anui keulia la; milung ketie, lungrei, kehebwak, keherei kecu gade, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />dap kecu, hebaang ketei, kehebwak, heta ketei, zip gai kelak, kemzeu gade, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />kemci, maci, milung ketie, mizai keyi, Kemci Rabe, keku kesangbe gade, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />sam kesangbe gade, Tinggwang kengkieng gade; anui ba zetle nah hile kesamsang reunet keteu gade, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />herüt kepeu nah herüt peu kemak gade, rang kemsia nah rang kehemi dau liede, anuide kenret mege nzwala, dede kesangbe rangla; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />ci kemakme nzwa, dede ci hemisüt; ketsaime nzwa dede, ainie ringbam; teikeherei dede teitset dima;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:9">1 Cor. 4:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:18">Lei. 118:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />suisiet teupung kebamme nzwa, dede suiyi bam muila; kegahme nzwa, dede mahei kekiee ge hekwalu; magede kegah nzwa, dede maleune bamla.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Corinth ga kebam sinamedung! Anui masang eh nnuide ranglia gaida, nah anui nlung nnuide ngkei mzaha pwa peubam. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Anui nnuide kaam ma, dede nnui lung ga kebam kecet dene nnuide kaam dida. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Cu nnuide henamedung dage nzwa Ih rangla—makeyi tei regwalu—nnui lung ngkei nza silu.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nlumkemakme de ngngwa ngwanggai ncüt so</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Nlumkemakme de ngngwa ngwanggai ncüt so. Dainzwa makesangbe nah hezai kegah ngngwa hekang lulai? Mede dainzwa kebaa kemui de ngngwa kekangbau lulai? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nah Khrista Beliar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beliar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan</char></note> de ngngwa dai kesamdau pwa bamno? Mede kenlumme ge nlumkemakme de ngngwa daige kemacüt bam no? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nah Tinggwang kerecaki mamiedung de ngngwa daipai samdau pwabam no? Kedanemene anui au ringkela Tinggwang kerecaki, Tinggwang rang kegai nzwa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Ih penui kakga lungh bam zie, nah penui kakga tet lazie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">nah Ih penui Tinggwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">nah penui a minadung zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev. 26:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:38">Jer. 32:38</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Eze. 37:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Ciziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Penui kakgade mpet dilu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">nah tsam dilu,” de eh Rampaube rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“nah mcikemakbe deuso,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“iciude Ih nnuide ngngwa luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa. 52:11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">Jer. 51:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />“Nah Ih nnui pei tei luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">nah nnui a napeime nah a napuime tei luzie,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Hel. 17:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa. 43:6</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos. 1:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:18">Ngkiengtube Rampaube rangla.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Akumedung, sampet aidungde anui da kebamne, anuikatei anuide pumteih nah rabe teihera kedidung gade teimci kap lugo, nah Tinggwang mie hing eh mcicang lulo.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul suiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Anui dage nnui lung ngkeigai lo! Anui migede de kemau ta teigai ma. Anui migede de tei rejam dima, anui migede de cwa dima. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ih nnuide mmaugai kerane rang ma; kedanemene nnui au anui lung ga bamlie Ih ranggai da, anui ngngwa ket tei bammui kera, ringde nah tsaide. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nnuida a kenlum kedi ge bam; nnui ziemne Ih hegiesüt lula. A lung ga kekuu le puibam. Anui reidung pelane gade suiyi ada pui nliem bam.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Anui Macedonia deuceu ga gwang keludaude, anui pumteih kemtak gede bam ma. Meliene, kehei gade anui da kehebwak le puidi—hegwale ngngwa kesia nah milung ga kengngi. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Dede Tinggwang, pesui ngkung kelame de lungciep peu kelabe, Titus gwang kegai gade anuide lungciep peu, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />nah pa kegwang gade rünne mene, dede nnui lungciep teu pelung tei relui kegai gade de. Pa nnui regui bam kela, nnui suisia bam kela, nah acu hengin kebam de anui dage paulia gia, iciu eh a suiyi de kiee silu. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Kedanemene Ih nnuide laisiu raukegai gade nnui suisiet teidi liede, Ih cide ngngai ma (keraidau Ih ngngai liede) kedanemene laisiu cide nnui suisiet teidi liede tingkaknage gwale kemak Ih cilu. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Cu Ih a suiyi bam, nnui lungrei kebam ziemne ma, dede nnui lung rei eh helungnreu kelune. Kedanemene Tinggwang lungning gage nnui lung reigai, ciu eh keheibe gade de nnui anui ziemne kekap dau melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kedanemene Tinggwang suisiet kai kegai mariemde au kelikelu helungkenreu ngngai dila kemak teugwang beula. Dede kideu suisiet au ketsai peula. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Pielo, Tinggwang lungning gade nnui lung rei kegaidau aide ne nnui dade daige petlu dibi: nnui lung kaisüt, nnui nzeu lie kecu laikai teisüt, nnui rata süt, nah ngngi süt, nnui hengin süt nah nnui laikai teisüt, nah kemau de saja peu! Nnui maleune ga nnuikatei nnuide aide ga nzeu lie kecu lia gaida. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Cine Ih nnui dage raugai liede, cide mateimau kedibe ziemne ma, mede matei maugai eh keherei kegaibe ziemne de ma, dede nnui anui keleu tei eh laikai tei kegaide Tinggwang dwagade nnuide lialu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Aipau kiede ziemne anuide tei ngkuulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Cu anui kerelui ngau kelu nreu de, Titus suiyi de ziemne anui suiyi sütlu, kedanemene nnui pelane pe lung tei relui kebeune. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ih pe dade nnui ziemne keheigade hegiedi liede, Ih ngngam dima. Meliene, anui nnui dage maleune kesangbe gade rang kegai nzwa, anui Titus dade hegie kegaide au kesang kecu ci luda. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Nah pa nnuide keku de au diki, kedanemene nnui pelane pe samzai tei, nah nnui ngngi nah mbeu eh pecu ngngwa kelude pa nsung bamlu. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ih a suiyi la kedanemene ma pelane gade nnuida a kenlum kebam ziemne.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mbang lo eh kecung kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Cu anui nnuide peu cigai neula, sinamedung, Tinggwang ngaugia Macedonia ngqwadung dage peu kegaide, <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />kehereisüt eh kedak kecu ting ga, penui suiyisüt nah penui magah süt liede mbang süt eh mide ma pwapeu. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ih rangmci lia gaila, penui teilukebui nzüt gade, nah peulu kebui nreu, neu ngnga eh peu kegai, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />penui kemcime de ngha kecu tade ga ngngwa heta tei kera ziuyi keyi peulo anui dade penui ngngia kiesünne gai. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Nah penui aide anui cet mning kebam nzwa teima, dede Tinggwang lungning gade keraibe penuide kaipwa Tinggwang de peu nah pecai anui dage. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Cine anui Titus de kecunggai, pa ngaugia ta aide tei ndeukelu nzwa pa tei kelade nnui kakga cide teigwang canglu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Dede nnui maleune gade—kenlum, kerang, maci, nah laikai tei kegai leune gade, nah anuide keku ga,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">laisiudung yitube ga, </char><char style="fqa">nah anuide nnuide keku ga </char> de peila. Keda laisiudung ga, <char style="fqa">nah nnui anuide keku ga </char> de peila. </note> yiki kebam nzwa, ngaugia ta aide gade nnui yiki lu maisia. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ih aide aja ge nzwa rang ma, dede nnui laikai tei eh mi kedame dage heta tei kecu ga nnui keku kesang de pie kerane. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Kedanemene nnui anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia de cibam, pa mahei liede, nnui ziemne kegahme ge tei, ciu eh pe magah de ziemne nnui maheilu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Cine Ih aipau hade ga a lungcet nzi gaila, aide nnui gwang kedi mmi ga tei ndeu kelu rünne ma, dede neungga eh cide teilu neukelade nnui ziemne kemmi ge. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Cine cu cide de teicang lulo, ciu eh nnui neungga eh teilu neu kela nzwa, neugga eh cide tei canglu kerane, nnui da kebam de teu delwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kedanemene nnui neungga eh bam cai, mige kebam nzüt gade cide luu lubui, pa bam kemak nzüt gade di mene. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Kedanemene aide nnuide teikeherei delwe mi kedage de peu reluilu kera ziemne ma, nah kerane ma, dede kensambe peu bamlu kera ziemne. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Cu ting ga, nnui da mahei kebam de penui teu maisia kebam ziemne da, ciu eh penui mahei de nnui teu mai kesia dau ziemne zie, ciu eh kensambe bamlu kerane, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />ainzwa eh kesanglaisiu ga rau teula:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">“Hekwa kieesüt kelume de magede bangswa ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">nah kecam nage hekwa kelume de cam dima.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Tet. 16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Dede Tinggwang de twa, pa Titus lung ga anui nzwa nnuide ngngha neusüt kecu lung teigai kebeune. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Kedanemene pa anui rang kegaide luu kelu rünne ma, dede neungga eh pa pekatei cet mning kelu gade nnui da gwang. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Pecu ngngwa anui sinabe pe samliakeyi ta keteide ziemne ngqwa leune twabam kelabe de anui langgai dida. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Nah aide rünne ma, dede pecu ngqwadung ne kedetlu, anui hebeuh ketei ga anui kangngwa tei kera nah Rampaube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rampaube </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peibe, Tinggwang</char></note> kendu ziemne anui tei kebam ngaugia ta ketei ga anuide ngngwa heta tei kera, nah anui nghaneu kelade keulia lu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Anui aide riem sünne lu, ciu eh anui mbang eh kepeu ta tei kebamde ziemne peu migede de anuide mmaudi melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Kedanemene anui Rampaube dwade rünne ma, dede mina dwade de dai petau bi tei kera mrai riemlu. <verse eid="2CO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Penaide ngngwa anui sinabe pecu ma kekiee gega mcet siakte gai, nah laikai tei kela ngau kelube de anui langgai la. Nah pa cu laikai tei ki dida kedanemene nnui da pa pekenlum kedi ge kebamne. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titus au a zangbe nah acu ngngwa nnui ziemne heta teikelabe. Titus de nzangkela anui zangmedung cai, ngqwadung ne penuide langgai nah Khrista de kendu teugwang beula. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Cine ngqwadung dwade penuide nnui mide ku kelade nah anui nnui ziemne hegie kelade lia gailo.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Jerusalem ga kenlumme ziemne heta tei kegai ha Ih nnui dage raugai mede yida. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Kedanemene nnui ngha neu kebam Ih cibam, nah Macedoniame dade Ih nnui ha ziemne ngang eh, “Achaiame nziekum de ngha kera mtei pwa bam dida,” de rangbeu. Nah nnui siering kebam dene penui kekiee gede kecung silu. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Dede Ih sinamedung de lang gai dida iciu eh nnui ziemne anui hegie kelade peu kemta teidi melu kerane, iciu eh Ih nnui dage kerang nzwa nnui mteilu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Maige, magade Macedoniame mikang ge acu ngngwa gwang eh nnui mteilu mene bam eh ngau cai, anui hengam ngau zie—nnui ngam meliene, nnuide mning mmi süt kecune. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Cine Ih sinamedung de kecung gai mai kesia cetlu ciude penui gwang nswa eh nnui sampet kebeu mapeu aide mtei nswalu kerane. Iciu eh cide tei maisia lu de mene neungga eh mtei mzeulu kerane.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbang eh kemrok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Cu Ih aide ranggaila, gi cam kegaibe, rum cam de zie, nah samlam ngaulu kerane gi kegaibe samlam cide rum dai zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:24">Mac. 11:24</ref>;<ref loc="PRO 22:9">22:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Keheibe de peu pe lung gade riem kelu nzwa peulo, raungga mene mede maisia lu de mene, kedanemene Tinggwang pe suiyi eh peu kelame de pe suila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10">Hez. 18:10</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 22:9">Mac. 22:9</ref>;<ref loc="PRO 11:25">11:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nah Tinggwang ngaugia pelane pwa ncu peulu kebui bam, ciu eh ma pelane gade, kehei daude, nang teu maikesia leune bam eh, heta keyi leune ga nda kepui bamlu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kesanglaisiu ga rauteukela nzwa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Pa mbang süt eh peula, pa kegahme de peula;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">pe masang kelungta la muizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Lei. 112:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Heleuh gi kera peu kelabe nah taktyei ziemne tangku peu kelabe, nnui gi kera heleuh peu nah tei ngkiee beuzie, nah nnui kesamsang tsi tei ngkiee beuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa. 55:10</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 10:12">Hos. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Maleune ga nnuide peu mbang bamlu kerane tei mahei beuzie, nah cide ziemne anui Tinggwang de ketwa peu luzie. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Kedanemene heta aide tei kebam ga kemcime rünne de ngha kelu rünne ma, dede Tinggwang de ketwa kekiee ge petsi lula. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Heta aide tei kegai ziemne, nnui Khrista samliakeyi zierang ketei ga samzai tei nah nnui mbang eh mapeu penuide nah mileune de ngngwa mzi kegai ziemne penui Tinggwang de twala. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Nah penui kekie au nnui ziemne, Tinggwang ngaugia kedi nnui da kebamne nnui gwang kera de reguibam. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tinggwang mapeu rangkap gai kelak de ziemne pecu twalo.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paul pe bata regum kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Cu Ih, Paul, nnui dade kiebi gaila, Khrista henah nah nciep kecu gade—Ih nnuide ngngwa kebamdau henah nah nciep, dede Ih nnuide ngngwa bam kemakdau Ih kuu dila! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ih kegwangdau a lung tei msia melu kerane Ih nnui dade kie gaila, midungge anuide pumteih zai gade heta tei lalie rang kelame dade Ih a zai siasüt zielu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Kedanemene anui pumteihbe ga la liede, pumteihbe zai teu regi lama. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Anui reunet teu regi keladung au pumteihbe gu ma, dede kengkiengbam tei msialu kera nah kesamlim kecu dungde teu ngkaulu kera Tinggwang kengkieng, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />nah ngang cu Tinggwang maci de renia kela leune de, nah anui lungcet leune teu Khrista samzai baang tei lula. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Nah nnui samzai teicang kelucai, anui samzai teikemakta leune de saja peu kera mtei luzie. <verse eid="2CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nnui ma hegwazu piebam dida. Keheibe de pekatei pecu le Khrista gu lie lacai, peu pecu cetdai lulo, pa Khrista gu kecu nzwa anuide Khrista gu delu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Kedanemene nnuide tei ngkap kedi be mene nnuide teucuh lu kerane Rampaube anuide kepeu kengkieng de ziemne Ih ngangla liede, Ih ngngam dilak. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Iciu eh Ih a laisiu dele nnuide keheu kera nzwadi melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Kesang, nnui mikangge rang eh, “Paul laisiudung au ngkieng nah ci, dede pa anuide ngngwa kebam dau au mnei, nah pe marang au pemi gah.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Peu cikenzwame de anui nnuide ngngwa bam kemak dau laisiu ga rau kegai nzwa, anui gwang tei zielie kecu cilu maisia. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Midungge penuikatei penuide twa kelame dade anui hemaa tei ntsam mede anuide keu keda lama. Dede penuikatei penuide teu kedame de mdet, nah penuide keu kedame de teu keda kelame au magede cima. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ciuliede anui teigai kelak nreu ngang dilak, dede Tinggwang anuide nlum kebeu ta gade zie, cide nnui dede si. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Anui katei anuide tei mdi lama, anui nnuida gwang kemak nzwa, kedanemene anui Khrista samliakeyi teu kemdei nnui taiga kecang gwang da. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Anui nganglu kebui nreu ngang di lama, mi kedame tadung ziemne, dede anui keregui au nnui kenlum mmi reureu de nnui kakga anui ta tei mdi silu kera deda, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />ciu eh nnui swa kemdei cuikuidung ga samliakeyi de paulu kerane, nah mi kedame dage heta tei keludung ziemne ngang melu kerane.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kesanglaisiu rangkela nzwa, “Dede peu ngang kelabe de Rampaube gade nganglu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer. 9:24</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1 Cor. 1:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Kedanemene pekatei pecu twa kelabe de luulu lama, dede Tinggwang ne twa kelabe de luu lula.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paul nah langkegai kenretme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ih mie nakke liede nnuide peu acu ngngwa lialu neu bam, dede kesang nnui acu ngngwa lia bamda! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Kedanemene Ih nnui ziemne rabe lungriak teu eh ariak lala, kedanemene Ih nnuide pwa mipei hangge dage tei mmeu beukera sampet dida, nnuide relei kemci ge nzwa Khrista de peulu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Dede heneibe pe ningcing yi delwe Eve de cwakedi nzwa, nnui lungcet lungsang nah kemci Khrista da kebam de kemau gage teugaidi kera Ih hing bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Ken. 3:13</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 3:5">1 The. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kedanemene mige gwang anui pe zierang teila kemak keda Jisu zierang teicai, mede nnui luu kelu rabe kemak kedage de nnui luulu cai, mede nnui luu kelu samlia kemak kedage nnui luulu cai, nnui cide samzai teisüt la dida! <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ih de, “kemlang-langkegaimedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemlang-langkegaimedung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kenret keledeume langkegaime lie mtei teukelame.</char></note>” swade heleidi mezing lie Ih cet. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ih sam kerang ga keteulu meliede, Ih maci lam au keteulu kemakme ma. Dede keheibe gade anui ma pelane ga nnuide peu aide ci mci gaida. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ih Tinggwang samliakeyi de nnui dage pemi tei mene zierang tei kegai ziemne, nah Ih nnuide teucuhlu kerane acu tei henah kegaine Ih kemau teidi dini? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Nnui dage heta tei kerane Ih ngqwa kedadung hema tui eh penui dade hema luulu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ih nnuide ngngwa kebam dau, Ih teu maisia dide, Ih migede de tei naang dima. Kedanemene sinamedung Macedonia gade kegwangme Ih teumai kesia leune pwapeu. Ih nnuide tei nnangdi melu kerane mapelane gade Ih akatei acu kezeula, nah Ih cide tei eh lazie. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Khrista masangde a dala, iciu eh Ih hegie kela aide Achaia deuceu ga nlei tadi melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Daitei? Ih nnuide hung kemak ziemne ni? Ih hung kela Tinggwang cibam! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Nah Ih tei kelade Ih tei jüja lazie, iciu eh penui ngang eh anui nzwa teila delie lu kerane ziuyi keyi pei kelame ziuyi de Ih keuteu dilu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Kedanemene mina cikenzwame au langkegai kenretmedung, kecwa ta tei kelame, penuikatei penuide Khrista ne langkegaime rehi teipung eh lala. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Miswakegah ge dema, kedanemene Satan kecangde pekatei pecu le kebaabe tinggimgwame rehi teipung eh lalu. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Cine Satan kilamedung makesang kilamedung rehi teipung lade cide miswakegah ge dema. Kekamle penui batadung nzwa penui ziehi ngau zie.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul pe rei ziemne hegie kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ih rang daila: peu migede de Ih kemieme gelie kecu cet so. Dede nnui ciciu cet lacai, acu kemieme ge nzwa ngngwa lulo, iciude Ih de manage hegie luzie. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Ih rang kebam de, Ih Rampaube ne rang kera nzwa rang ma, dede kemieme ge nzwa hegiekela zai aide gade. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Mi kekiee ge pumteih lungningbe gade hegie kela nzwa, Ih de hegie zie. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Cine nnui, mriak kecume, nnui suingga eh kemieme de ngngwa lialu. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Kedanemene mige nnuide kila tei leide, mede mige nnuide ngkapdi liede, mede mige nnuide masipei meliede, mede mige pekatei pecu twala liede, mede mige nnui zu kepeu liede, nnui cide ngngwa lialu. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Anui cide ziemne mneisüt lie kecu rang kera Ih ngngam lie! Ciuliede, mikeheibe de ma keheibe ga kuu eh hegie lacai, Ih kemieme ge nzwa rangla, Ih de cide ziemne hegiela. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Penui Hebrewme ni? Ih deda. Penui Israelme ni? Ih deda. Penui Abraham leuhme ni? Ih deda. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Penui Khrista kilamedung ni? (Ih kemieme nzwa rangbam dida.) Ih au yiki kecume ge: heta tei ncokki, hebaang tei kieeki, peikap gai kelak ge dap, tsailu kebui kengyi pia kekieege dau. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Jewme muiteume ne acu teigeuria le “camreiehekui” kecu pia mengei dap.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hezaidung 25:1-3 gade ngau lula, Hebrewme tutiakki gade kemaume gede teigeuria le dap eh saja peula kecu zai gade kieetubede pia riakdai dapla. Pia riakdai de pei maudi eh hezaibe gikahdi melu kerane, hezai gade teigeuria le pia camreiehekui dap la. </char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Piacum acu hegeutie le dap. Piage acu tangtsu le sam. Piacum lim nlim kecu Ih dau. Tingmui ziu ge nah tingba zie ge Ih dui kedi ga ladi. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ih hebeuh kekiee ketei ga kengngi gala, hereuki gade, sütketyeime dade, a ramme dade, Gentileme dade, namdi gade, hetaideu gade, jaaidi gade, nah masangkemak kenlumme dade kengngi gala. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ih bata kehung nah keherei daugwang, tingmui zip kemak ting kekieege dau, mzeu nah hereu, pia kekieege mmwang, ngkung nah paini teu kemak daugwang. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kedabedung reude, tingnai ramsangne ngqwadung pelane ziemne a da lungnei le pui bamla. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Mige mnei dige, Ih de mnei dila; mige kemau tei dige, Ih lungrei le pui dila. <verse eid="2CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ih hegie maisia cai, a kemnei keulia kelabedung ziemne Ih hegie zie. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Pei, hetwa pung mui kelabe, Ih au nretla kemak cibam. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Damascus ga, hegwangpei Aretas kangga deuceudibe acu tui kerane namdi de kwalu. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Dede kirie ga hebaki ge gade acu marak ge gage pwa nghung beu, nah Ih pe ba gade paklu.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Paul makengau nah pe pumteih ga hetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ih hegie maisia, kemmi gede gah liede. Dede Rampaube dade kegwang marengeidung nah keuliakegaidung de ha Ih rangla zie. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ih mige Khrista de kecime ge mmi kereiemdai dwa tinggim pekecumbe ga ngngwa nghang kedi ci, Ih pe pumteihbe simi mebi ci ma. Tinggwang cibam. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Nah Ih mina aipaude de—pe pumteihbe de simi, pe pumteihbe de si mebi Ih cima, Tinggwang cibam— <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />pecu kereluini ga ngngwa nghangdi nah pa rang cigai kelak samdung, mina depeu rangkelakbe siu. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Mina ai kenzwame ziemne Ih hegie zie. Dede Ih akatei a ziemne hegie lak, a kemneidung ziemne zielie maige. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ih hegie neula liede, Ih kemieme ge tei dilak, kedanemene Ih kesangbe rang zielu. Dede Ih ma aidungde tei meda, ciu eh migede ada de pa kengaude mede kesiude gwale mning mmiki melu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Nah iciu eh keuliakegai miswakegah de ziemne Ih a zaidi melu kerane, a pumteih ga hetu ge kai pwabam, satan samgwame ge, Ih a zaidi melu kerane pa acu teikeherei kerane. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ih piacum Rampaube dade cide peu a dade tetdi lulo a nggia kie. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Dede pa a dage ranggai, “A ngaugia de nang teumai kesia pelane da, kedanemene kemnei gade a kengkieng tei mmi canglu lalu.” Cine Ih a kemnei de ziemne a suiyi eh ngangki zie, iciu eh Khrista kengkieng de a da bamlu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ciziemne Ih Khrista ziemne kemnei ga, kii kegaidung ga, kehereidung ga, teikeherei nah suisiet dau kecu ga Ih nnung bam. Kedanemene Ih mnei kebam dau, Ih ngkieng kebamne.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Corinthiame ziemne lungnei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ih kemieme ge dida! Nnui ne acu aide tei kera ketang, nnui ne acu twa kerabe nsam liede. Kedanemene Ih magede melie de cipau “kemlang-langkegaimedung,” swade Ih de sia swama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:13">11:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Langkegaime ge kesang rehidung de helung tie eh nnui kakga teilia gaida, marehidung nah miswakegahdung nah mimakecang batadung tei eh. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Dai rehi gade ngqwa kedadung de swade nnuide be pie msiaki no, Ih nnuida gwang eh nnuide tei nrütdi kemak gwale? A mau aide gibeu lo! <verse eid="2CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ainie! Ih pia pe kecumbe nnuida gwang kera mtei luda, nah Ih nnuide tei nrüt dilak. Kedanemene Ih nnui gudung peei ma, dede nnuide peeila. Kedanemene henamedung pe penui puipei ziemne ma hekwa kerabe ma, dede penui puipei pe name ziemne ma hekwala. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Cu au Ih a suiyisüt eh mpet peuzie, nah nnui rabedung ziemne mpet cangsiak beuzie. Ih nnuide kuki cai, acu be ku cam kerabe ni? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Dede cinzwa liede, Ih nnuide teinrüt dima, dede midungge Ih heciem tei eh nnuide cwadi lie rangla. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ih nnui dage mina langkegai gade nnui ziuyi keuteu dini? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ih Titus de nnui da gwang kerane kecunggai, nah pe dage sinabe keda gede langgai. Titus nnui dade pe ziuyi peei ni? Titus anai lungge tei eh tet meni? Anai pikie gega ngngwa tet meni? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Anui nnui dade anui nzeu rang lalie nnui cet lani? Anui Tinggwang dwade Khrista zi teu eh rangbam, dede ma aidung pelane, kehungmedung, nnuide teingkieng lu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Kedanemene Ih kegwang dau Ih nnuide regui kela nzwa nah nnui acu regui kela nzwa ngaulu tadi kera Ih hing bamlie. Kesamlim kecu, miriak kecu, rata, kengaurau, mide rang kemsia, kemta sam kerang, ngang kecu, nah kehebwak bamdi lubui. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ih gwangdai lude, nnui dwade a Tinggwang acu tei henahbeu lubui, nah mina kekiee ge kemau tei kedime nah mcikemak nah kemmha ta nah pumteih lungningbe tei kela gade penui lung nreulu kemakme de ngau eh Ih asui sia dizie.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Rangmriak kegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Aide Ih nnuida kegwang pia pe kecumbe zieda. “Ma keheibe leune de hangna mede hangcum zierang gade teilu maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Hez. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ih pia pe kenabe kegwang dau Ih mrai rangbeu dida, nah Ih cu bam meliede, pedwa kemau tei kedime nah keda pelane de Ih mrai rang gaila, Ih penui da gwang dai lucai, Ih migede de mbai beulak, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Kedanemene nnui Khrista a dade marang kebamde ci mci neu lalu. Pa au nnui dade mnei ma, dede nnui kakga ngkieng süt. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Kedanemene pecu kemnei gade gwakdi, dede Tinggwang kengkieng gade pa ringlu. Anui de pe dade mnei, dede nnui dade anui pecu ngngwa Tinggwang kengkieng gade ring luzie. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Nnui kenlum ga bammi mebi kecu nnuikatei nnuide mcet gai pielo. Nnuikatei nnuide kedak pielo. Nnui Jisu Khrista nnuida kebam de ci meni—kedak kegai gade nnui siadi zielie mai? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Nah anui kedak kegaide gade siadi kemak nnui cilu kera Ih nlum. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Cu nnui magede tei maudi melu kerane anui Tinggwang dade kiela, anui kedak kegaide gade yilu lie kecu liagai kerane ma, dede nnuide peu petaube teilu kerane, anui kedak kegai gade siadi kecu nzwadi liede. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kedanemene anui kesangbe de mmau eh ma gede tei gailak, dede kesangbe ziemne rünne teila. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Kedanemene anui kemnei dau nah nnui kengkieng dau anui suiyi bamla. Anui kie kelade au peu nnuide yicanglu kerane. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ciziemne, Ih nnuida bam kemakdau ma aidungde laisiu aikage rau gaila, ciu eh Ih kegwangdau, a kengkieng de teu Ih nnui dade a zaisiadi melu kerane—cide Rampaube nnuide teu cuhlu kera ziemne acu pwapeu, nnuide teu kaudi kera ziemne ma.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Kekambe, sinamedung, nnui suiyi lu! Yicangsiak lu, hangge ge de kecunglu, kesuizwa lu, kezuyi eh lunghlu. Iciu de keku nah lungciep Tinggwang nnuide ngngwala luzie. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Kemci kemam ge teu hangge ge de kelumlu. Aika kebam kemcimedung pelane nnuide kelum gaila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">kemcimedung pelane nnuide kelum gaila, </char> de kecu de pedum 13 gage kaila, dede laisiu yitubedung ga aika sila. </note><verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia, nah Tinggwang keku, nah Kemci Rabe gade ngngwa ket keteide peu nnui pelane da bam kelube tei lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung </char><char style="fqa">kemcimedung pelane nnuide kelum gaila, </char> de kecu de pedum 12 gade keu mpet pedum 13 gage kaila, nah pedum 13 de pedum 14 tei dila. </note><verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>